WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Hi everyone! Welcome to Nivela. In this quick video, I’m going to show you around your platform so you can navigate easily and start your learning journey.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Before we check the main page, take a look at the top-right header. 

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
You can click this 'Aa' button to change the text size for optimal reading comfort, or click the contrast button to switch color modes. 

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Right next to it, you'll see your profile initial, we’ll click that in a moment!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Now, let's look at the left sidebar menu. This is your navigation hub! Here you can access the Home dashboard, 

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
jump into exciting gamified lessons inside the Challenges tab, 

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
look at the entire study timeline under Units, or customize accessibility controls.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:53.000
At the very bottom of the sidebar, you can find support under Help, or securely exit your current session by clicking Sign out.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Back on our Home tab, your main dashboard features a personalized greeting followed by your main stats: 

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.000
your Leaderboard rank, your earned Badges, and your Accuracy percentage.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Just below, the purple 'Your progress' banner displays your active points, your current login streak, and a progress bar showing how many lessons you’ve finished.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Our lessons are designed to be taken step-by-step. 

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.000
As you can see, Lesson 1 is unlocked and ready to start. 

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
However, Lesson 2 and 3 are locked with padlocks; they will open automatically as soon as you finish the first lesson!

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:34.000
If you want a study boost, scroll down to the Daily Challenge and click this green 'Start' button to begin a timed practice session.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:41.000
Finally, let’s click on our initial at the top right. This takes us directly to the User profile page!

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here, you can update your credentials like your Name, Email, or Password using the edit icon. 

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:54.000
You can also monitor your active unit checkpoint and see your total earned points.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:01.000
And that’s it! You’re all set to master your English goals. Have fun learning with Nivela, and see you next time!